    },
    {
      "id": "cb-xtreme-4kh2pq",
      "text": "YO GENERAL, that corona's cookin' the pavement but NDG's out there struttin' like it's a SPA DAY - I got him surviving the next FIVE MINUTES at even odds, you want a piece of that or you still cryin' about your 1-1 record? CEE-LO WITH XTREME, baby, the line is GENEROUS, and hey, matching sun-bleached tees are twenty gold, they practically sell THEMSELVES out here.",
