    },
    {
      "id": "cb-xtreme-4lf3gh",
      "text": "CLAUSEN! Contract-face queen herself, lookin' HOT under them neon lights, baby! Heard NDG ate it AGAIN yesterday, terrible luck, beautiful death, and I still got money movin' on it - you want in on CEE-LO WITH XTREME or you here to serve HELL some paperwork? Either way, shirt's fifteen, NDG WINS ALWAYS, it's basically scripture at this point.",
