    {
      "id": "cb-xtreme-dhlidg",
      "text": "YO YO YO if it ain't BOO G, THE DAMNED MOUTH HIMSELF, lookin' cold as a HELL WINTER over there! Two and five got you frosty, baby, but the LINE don't care about your feelings - you want in on CEE-LO WITH XTREME or you just here to admire the pins on my jacket? NDG WINS ALWAYS, it's on the shirt, the shirt is fifteen, YOU KNOW THIS.",
      "speaker": {
