    },
    {
      "id": "cb-xtreme-kx269b",
      "text": "YO the MOON just ATE my gold like it was a SNACK, Stitch-Up, that's cold, colder than this stupid wind. Six and nine ain't a record, it's a CRY FOR HELP, you want a shirt that says NDG WINS ALWAYS so bad luck stops rubbin off on you? Fifteen gold, it's basically medicine.",
